.TH pe_thunk 3
.SH NAME
pe_thunk \- resolve PE import thunk
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "pe.h"
.PP
.BI "uint64 pe_thunk(void *" pe ", void *" ptr ", int64 " index ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pe_thunk
resolves an entry in a PE import thunk table at the specified
.I index
and returns the value as a 64-bit integer, handling both 32-bit and 64-bit PE formats.